podman (@PODMAN_VERSION@-@PKGREL@) @SUITE@; urgency=medium

  * Repackaged self-contained build of podman bundling netavark, aardvark-dns,
    catatonit, rootlessport, quadlet, and the buildah CLI.  No external
    netavark, aardvark-dns, or catatonit package required; the exact bundled
    versions are recorded in this package's Provides field.
  * Networking via netavark (nftables-only; iptables support was removed in
    netavark 2.0).
  * Rootless networking via passt/pasta (slirp4netns removed in podman 6.0).
  * cgroups v2 required at runtime.

 -- The Wondersmith <the@wondersmith.dev>  @BUILD_DATE@
